  "heat_input": {
    "form": "q_i = (V/v_ref_ms) * [ r_i*sqrt(lat_g^2 + brake_g^2) + d*acc_g*[driven_i] ] + c_b*brake_g*(V/v_ref_ms)*[front_i]; r_i = W_i(t)/W_i,static from the quasi-static load transfer of geometry_by_car (force x slip fraction x speed: slip is a kinematic fraction near the optimum, so heat is linear in the force); dT/dt = a*q_i - b_axle*(T - T_eff)",
    "v_ref_ms": 30.0,
    "force_exp": 1.0,
    "speed_exp": 1.0,
    "geometry_by_car": {
      "Inferno 86": {
        "wdf": 0.53,
